docs/spikes/evidence/native-cpu-profiling/native-cpu-profiler-checks-001/profile-behavior-003.log -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof
docs/spikes/evidence/native-cpu-profiling/native-cpu-profiler-checks-001/profile-initial.log -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof
